# D3-TR-008: A metal bed can transform an incoming dissolved-metal stream
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
new
new
add v1 water 20mL
add v1 Fe 0.001mol
add v2 water 20mL
add v3 water 20mL
add v4 water 20mL
add v4 CuSO4 0.0001mol
transport v1 v2 v3 from v4 to v5 steps 3 courant 0.5
inspect
transport v1 v2 v3 from v4 to v5 steps 6 courant 0.5
look v1
measure v5 uvvis
particles v5
inspect
